{
  "name": "BestClassicWB device and datatype icons",
  "version": "2.1.12",
  "baseline": "2.1.12",
  "archives": {},
  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS Workbench"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Owns the 80 BCWB icon streams and the installed metadata of four shared drawers. The icons include replacements on unchanged AmigaOS payloads and companions for the additional monitor drivers, mountlists and datatype descriptors.",
    "Keep the literal Storage/DOSDrivers/__uae___AUX_info host-escape spelling alongside the AmigaOS AUX mountlist. Preserve all tooltypes and case-sensitive checkout names.",
    "PIPE.info and Disk.info are icon-only paths in the stock tree. The catalogue retains existing ViNCEd, network, printing and image datatype package ownership."
  ],
